#chip 16F886, 8

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Time unit 'us' (microseconds) on 16F886
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 1,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit
Dim Flag As Bit
Dim Cnt As Byte
Dim X As Byte
Dim Y As Byte
Dim W1 As Word
Dim W2 As Word
Repeat For 500 us
    Wait 10 us
End Repeat
Do
Loop
